Gremlins/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 4243, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 479, "last_played": 1769872927, "avatar": "f2bcc48972205225267df039f037fcf02d57af9f"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you're fond of Overwatch, but hate the devs, monitization, other players, and just need an excuse to play with your Bro(Bot)?\n\nThis would be the game for you! What's better then avoiding EVERYTHING bad about a game, and instead get everything that COULD'VE gone right happen instead?\nAmazing Progression system? \nSatisfying Gameplay?\nVisible increase in your own skill, and understanding the game itself?\nAmazing choices for building your Hunk of a bot?\nFast paced, stunning music, rewarding you for playing aggressively?\n\nI'd be disappointed to say, that you might've just found the game that you'll be stuck with for a good 80+ hours, and if you're into speedrunning and ain't planning on staying down from being kicked square in the mouth, another 200 easily. \n\nI cant recommend this game enough, I've grown addicted, and I need more, need more shoot, NEED MORE BROBOT ACTION!", "timestamp_created": 1698697329, "timestamp_updated": 1704815958, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}